WEBVTT

00:01:29.290 --> 00:01:30.590
Thank you.

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:49.280
Dear Manager,

00:01:49.510 --> 00:01:54.890
Please forgive me for behaving
the way I did the other day.

00:01:56.930 --> 00:02:03.920
I did not intend to be indecent.
Please understand that.

00:02:07.310 --> 00:02:08.740
from that incident

00:02:09.060 --> 00:02:13.430
I realized that I must face a
significant problem in my life head on.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:16.400
Significant problem.

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:29.650
Until I solve that problem,
I won't be able to see you for a while.

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:35.960
A while?

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:40.530
I wonder if Godai also gave up on me.

00:02:56.560 --> 00:02:58.050
Oh? Going out?

00:02:58.120 --> 00:02:59.500
Yes, stepping out.

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:02.380
What happened to you two last night?

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:03.430
Eh?

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:09.360
This morning Godai stood in
the hallway staring at your room.

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:16.560
What's the matter?
You don't have any pep.

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:17.860
Not really.

00:03:23.940 --> 00:03:25.630
I don't know where you're going,

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:28.710
but sometimes you should
get away for a change of scenery.

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:30.340
You're still young.

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:32.210
I have nothing to...

00:04:08.650 --> 00:04:09.870
Change of scenery?

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:19.060
A trip?

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:22.020
Yes, if possible for three to four days.

00:04:22.170 --> 00:04:23.950
Where are you going?

00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:26.170
I haven't decided yet.

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:30.240
It'll be the first trip I take alone.

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:32.410
The first time?

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:37.940
Manager, I heard you're taking a trip?

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:40.270
feeling guilty?

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:42.880
Why don't you two suggest
an itinerary?

00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:46.620
My pleasure.

00:04:51.690 --> 00:04:52.620
Um...

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:55.890
Let me see.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:05:00.000
I'd recommend Hokkaido for
this time of the year.

00:05:00.350 --> 00:05:04.370
No, Okinawa. She can go swimming.

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:07.470
I strongly push Hokkaido.

00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:10.980
Why don't we go to Shinshu and
drink up into the night?

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.980
Then Okinawa it is.

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:15.110
No, hairy crab in Hokkaido!

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:16.570
-Okinawa's shochu!
-Shinshu's buckwheat noodles!

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:17.580
Hairy crab!

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:18.630
Spirits!

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:21.180
Excuse me, but I...

00:05:21.260 --> 00:05:24.790
You need not worry.
Why don't you pack your bags?

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:26.230
Okay...

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:30.000
Tohoku may not be bad.
The sake is tasty there.

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.860
The same goes for Kyushu.

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:37.040
What became of Shinshu?
I'm for Shinshu.

00:05:37.420 --> 00:05:39.770
They aren't thinking of coming
with me, are they?

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:41.810
That does it.

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:46.240
Let's visit all the recommended places.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:48.920
I agree!

00:05:49.430 --> 00:05:50.980
You've got to be kidding!

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:54.660
Thank you for your help,
but I'll decide for myself.

00:05:55.760 --> 00:05:58.000
How unappreciative.

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:07.890
I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:10.540
Did you get back to Maison Ikkoku?

00:06:11.510 --> 00:06:16.180
Yeah, sad as it was.

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:18.880
You're such a crybaby.

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:23.220
Not me, Manager cried.

00:06:23.430 --> 00:06:24.180
Eh?

00:06:35.260 --> 00:06:37.290
Let's go, Manager.

00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:42.680
I jotted down my itinerary,
where I'll be staying.

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:44.810
There's no need for that.

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:47.890
Even if you aren't here,
the apartment won't fall to the ground.

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:49.760
Just in case.

00:06:50.060 --> 00:06:51.350
It'll be all right.

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:53.940
If anything happens,
it'll be too late anyway.

00:06:54.820 --> 00:06:57.080
I'll post it on my door.

00:06:57.890 --> 00:06:59.560
Do as you wish.

00:06:59.930 --> 00:07:03.580
Whatever it is, if you don't hurry
you won't make it.

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:20.640
Don't you get it? She adores you.

00:07:20.990 --> 00:07:23.500
But, but... It can't be.

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:27.640
There's no other way to interpret
what you just told me.

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:30.440
But we're talking about you
and Manager.

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:33.010
Whether it holds true for you two
is another story.

00:07:47.310 --> 00:07:50.750
So, was that it?
It wasn't my imagination.

00:07:51.310 --> 00:07:54.680
Others see it the same way.

00:08:04.230 --> 00:08:04.940
I'm back!

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:20.930
Why did she suddenly go on a trip?

00:08:25.220 --> 00:08:28.770
You'll be fine without me?

00:08:31.160 --> 00:08:33.140
I'll be all right.

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:56.400
I must do it!

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:59.630
I have to find out the meaning
behind her tears.

00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:23.260
Hey! Three more large beers,
over here!

00:09:24.110 --> 00:09:26.940
Miss, do you have appetizers?
Hors d'oeuvres?

00:09:28.800 --> 00:09:33.210
What's the matter, Manager?
You haven't had a drop yet.

00:09:33.490 --> 00:09:37.170
I'll say! It's your farewell party.

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:39.500
Listen to yourselves!

00:09:39.880 --> 00:09:44.010
I missed the train because of you.
The next train isn't until--

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:49.100
There, there. Can't put the train in reverse,
after you've passed the station.

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:54.230
Exactly. Let's drink up.

00:09:57.270 --> 00:10:00.070
Do you plan on keeping me here?

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:04.000
Two, three beers more.
The railroad track isn't going anywhere.

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:13.500
Hits the spot!

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:17.170
It's gone in no time.

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:19.990
Miss, do you have mackerel?

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:23.390
Excellent choice.

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:26.620
I think I'll have another.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:27.960
Shall we?

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:34.740
Excuse me.
I need to use the restroom.

00:10:35.710 --> 00:10:37.570
Hey! Are you running
away from us?

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.300
All aboard.

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:48.620
The train for Kanazawa
is about to leave.

00:10:49.550 --> 00:10:51.820
Please stand clear of closing doors.

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:16.160
It's as if I'm escaping by night.

00:11:16.380 --> 00:11:18.580
Say "ahhh."

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:20.620
Ahh...

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:55.270
Please wait, Manager.
I'll overcome my fear of dogs.

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:10.200
I'm far behind.
But I'll catch up with you, Manager.

00:13:05.980 --> 00:13:10.770
Other places tourists would visit
are Edomura and Danfuen.

00:13:11.090 --> 00:13:12.770
They're a distance from here,
but I'll have a look.

00:13:12.860 --> 00:13:13.750
Excuse me!

00:13:18.390 --> 00:13:20.250
Will you please take my picture?

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:22.780
Sure!

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:28.790
I'm ready!

00:13:36.150 --> 00:13:37.240
Smile!

00:13:43.940 --> 00:13:45.700
One more!

00:13:51.090 --> 00:13:52.540
Another one, please!

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:14.000
Are you by yourself?

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:20.720
Really! Traveling alone isn't the
least bit romantic, is it? It's boring.

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:22.940
Excuse me?

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:25.670
You're staying at Muroya Inn,
aren't you?

00:14:25.900 --> 00:14:27.440
I caught a glimpse of you
this morning.

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:32.520
By the way, I'm going
to Edomura by taxi.

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:34.760
Would you like to split
the fare with me?

00:14:35.030 --> 00:14:35.680
Eh?

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:44.820
Thank you!
I was just getting lonesome.

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:47.930
I was also feeling bored.

00:14:49.940 --> 00:14:51.110
Do you work?

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:56.020
Yes, I'm the resident manager
of an apartment building. And you?

00:14:56.680 --> 00:15:00.770
I was an office clerk until recently.
But I'm free of that now.

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:03.680
You're fortunate.

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:05.810
Not really.

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:17.400
Smile!

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:23.700
Thank you very much.

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:26.940
You're welcome. Here you go.

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:30.300
Thank you. This is for you.

00:15:30.390 --> 00:15:31.010
Eh?

00:15:33.400 --> 00:15:34.320
Goodbye.

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:36.440
Thank you!

00:15:38.400 --> 00:15:40.320
But I don't smoke.

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:45.100
Hey, you there!
What's the matter with you?

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:46.290
Huh?

00:15:47.510 --> 00:15:48.690
Can't you read?

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:55.430
Smoke in designated areas only!
Understood?

00:15:55.990 --> 00:15:57.650
No, I just--

00:15:58.090 --> 00:15:59.570
Are you going to deny it?

00:15:59.760 --> 00:16:02.650
How can you explain
all that at your feet?

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:03.880
At my feet?

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:08.490
Those aren't mine!

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:12.630
Are smokers so desperate, they have
to smoke in places like this?

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:13.750
I'm sorry.

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:16.000
Don't apologize to me.

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:22.740
Let's take a picture somewhere.

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:24.160
Yes, lets.

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:27.560
How about in front of there?

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:29.100
Okay.

00:16:30.680 --> 00:16:32.620
from now on, be more careful.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:36.020
I'm very sorry!

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:37.310
Huh?

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:39.350
Anything wrong?

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:40.630
No.

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:45.090
That sounded like Godai
but it couldn't be him.

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:46.420
Are you ready?

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:47.660
Yes.

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:54.470
Do you have a boyfriend?

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:56.060
Huh?

00:16:57.440 --> 00:16:59.610
You must have a wonderful boyfriend.

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:01.770
No, I don't.

00:17:10.890 --> 00:17:14.000
I won't be able to see you for a while.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:20.250
I don't have feelings for you anymore.

00:17:24.870 --> 00:17:27.560
No, you let them back
Into your memory.

00:17:28.430 --> 00:17:31.560
I have no choice but
to wait in front of the inn.

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:49.920
Shall we be leaving soon?

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:03.990
We're closing!

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:06.110
I'm sorry.

00:18:08.320 --> 00:18:10.810
Harumi, it's closing time.

00:18:19.220 --> 00:18:21.560
What's the matter?

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:27.240
When I'm alone, I feel like dying.

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:29.390
What?

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:35.540
MUROUYA INN

00:18:38.050 --> 00:18:40.780
She sure is late.

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:55.320
Shucks, I have to leave!

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:02.100
I wasn't lucky enough to get reservations
at the same inn.

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:04.840
Can't be helped since it's tourist season.

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:15.040
I had to quit my job because of him.

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:20.400
Oh? Boyfriend trouble?

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:26.080
I sent my itinerary to him before
I left on this trip.

00:19:27.300 --> 00:19:30.090
Details of when and where I'll be.

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:36.870
Can you understand? Edomura was
the last place we visited together.

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:41.130
I see.

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:44.970
It was all for nothing.

00:20:04.420 --> 00:20:05.970
Itineray, huh?

00:20:14.470 --> 00:20:18.160
Manager!

00:20:21.670 --> 00:20:25.040
Silly! That's too good to be true.

00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:46.750
Strange... Where could she be,
this late at night?

00:20:58.480 --> 00:21:05.010
Yes, Maison Ikkoku. Police? Godai?

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:09.150
Yes, Godai lives here.

00:21:11.220 --> 00:21:13.740
Anyway, he--

00:21:13.840 --> 00:21:18.230
He said Godai is being questioned.

00:21:18.310 --> 00:21:21.070
What did he get caught for?
Stealing panties?

00:21:22.940 --> 00:21:25.230
He wouldn't do anything like that.

00:21:28.080 --> 00:21:30.160
What the heck is going on?

00:21:46.430 --> 00:21:47.950
I apologize for yesterday.

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:51.420
Don't. Are you all right?

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:54.360
Yes, it was worth coming
on this trip.

00:21:54.930 --> 00:21:56.370
I got it all out of my system.

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:59.870
I'm glad to hear it.

00:22:00.350 --> 00:22:01.330
It was nice meeting you.

00:22:01.410 --> 00:22:02.170
Same here.

00:22:02.480 --> 00:22:04.170
Take care. Goodbye!

00:22:06.250 --> 00:22:09.820
Her itinerary says she'll arrive
in Wajima at 3:30.

00:22:10.890 --> 00:22:12.550
I'll get there before her, by train.

00:22:29.810 --> 00:22:31.960
That's her...

00:22:34.510 --> 00:22:36.280
Manager!

00:22:36.820 --> 00:22:37.400
Huh?

00:22:44.360 --> 00:22:45.080
We're departing.

00:23:09.940 --> 00:23:11.040
Who is he?

00:23:11.650 --> 00:23:15.340
Please let go of me!
Mind your own business!

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:18.580
fool! Were you planning to
jump into the street and kill yourself?

00:23:18.890 --> 00:23:19.900
fool!

00:23:20.950 --> 00:23:22.290
You have it all wrong!

00:23:22.600 --> 00:23:25.860
Are you going against me?

00:23:28.870 --> 00:23:35.260
Why is this happening?
Manager!

00:23:46.180 --> 00:23:47.640
A mixed bath?

00:23:48.020 --> 00:23:51.460
Manager and Godai run into each other
in a bathing area.

00:23:51.560 --> 00:23:53.750
Of course, they were naked!

00:23:54.120 --> 00:23:55.910
You're about the only one who bathes
with clothes on.

00:23:56.120 --> 00:24:00.640
Next: "All Right!
Alone in the Bath with Kyoko!"

00:24:00.740 --> 00:24:03.000
I'm...jealous!
